e a million other little things that need to be done as well.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That will cost a small fortune.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If you don't mind Peter, could I get you to help me and my landlord with a budget?"}, {"time": "64000", "image": "engenn9le01ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's my area of expertise!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This is so awesome! I have a friend who is an interior designer. We could get her to help us design your new kitchen.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well that's a nice offer, but I am pretty set with my own ideas.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? You could have fooled me!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}